    "decider": "project coordinator (delegated by the owner; owner ledger 2026-09-24, A12 decision: AUTH-ACCOUNT and AUTH-CREDENTIAL are re-promoted by the Claude lane on the final artifact; 2026-09-25: AUTH-ACTION with them on the integrated release artifact)",
    "reviewer": "re-promotion on the integrated v0.8.0 release artifact, decided by the project coordinator under the owner ledger criteria (the final-artifact regressions and the A12 row reproduced on the release binary); the independent v0.8.0 integration review checked the regression, the evidence bindings and the merges, and did not repeat a per-condition review",
    "reviewedCommit": "f8f0611ac35185a0719ae7660601ed4ac584dcad",
    "finalArtifactSha256": "a8bfc5dc1737dee01bae028b2e3dd421f04326e12640cb4936d896ebfcfa358a",
    "integratedArtifactSha256": "c258b022c5f452a60a9bc60de68e6de26b3f5aeaf846623cf1bf7e33f28d31df",
    "basis": "integratedRegression: every row of the committed lane comparison is identical on the release binary built from the integration head, with no production request.",
    "followUps": "Non-blocking Should items are tracked outside the closure (security hardening of hash verification under the store lock, duplicate-email password reset, export restorability of out-of-bound hashes, standard scrypt parallelism bound, handwritten figures).",
    "previousDecision": "APPROVED",
    "previousFinalArtifactSha256": "db8cafcd1c4dc8d56113a9b6b4c7dbd255154071f1a5c95dd27db2b43537ede4"
  },
  "scopeDecisions": [
    {
      "id": "A1",
      "decision": "Closure is defined by these behavioral acceptance conditions, as for FS-DATA-WRITE. Denominator surfaces with no account behavior are not enumerated here; surfaces that are account behavior are covered by the recipe of the condition that exercises them.",
      "decidedBy": "owner (t-k)",
      "decidedOn": "2026-09-23"
    },
    {
      "id": "A2",
      "decision": "All 14 production import hash algorithms are in scope; none is a documented divergence. fireemu implements verification for each.",
      "decidedBy": "owner (t-k)",
      "decidedOn": "2026-09-23"
    },
    {
      "id": "A3",
      "decision": "AUTH-ACCOUNT owns the effect of configured policies on account operations (duplicate emails, email privacy, password policy, client permissions). Config field parity, SDK policy projection and tenant inheritance belong to AUTH-CONFIG-SDK.",
      "decidedBy": "owner (t-k)",
      "decidedOn": "2026-09-23",
      "movedTo": "AUTH-CONFIG-SDK"
    },
    {
      "id": "A4",
      "decision": "Client IdP sign-in and linking through signInWithIdp needs a real external IdP and belongs to AUTH-FEDERATION. AUTH-ACCOUNT covers Admin link/unlink and client deleteProvider.",
      "decidedBy": "owner (t-k)",
      "decidedOn": "2026-09-23",
      "movedTo": "AUTH-FEDERATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "A5",
      "decision": "AUTH-ACCOUNT is observed through the REST surface. Client and Admin SDK end-to-end paths belong to AUTH-CONFIG-SDK.",
      "decidedBy": "owner (t-k)",
      "decidedOn": "2026-09-23",
      "movedTo": "AUTH-CONFIG-SDK"
    },
    {
      "id": "A6",
      "decision": "Token refusal codes after disable or delete are counted once, here, and referenced from AUTH-CREDENTIAL.",
      "decidedBy": "owner (t-k)",
      "decidedOn": "2026-09-23"
    },
    {
      "id": "A7",
      "decision": "Sign-up quota and abuse limits are production behavior and are not excluded; they are observed with the other project-level limits in AUTH-CONFIG-SDK. Any HTTP 429 in this corpus is classified INDETERMINATE.",
      "decidedBy": "owner (t-k)",
      "decidedOn": "2026-09-23",
      "movedTo": "AUTH-CONFIG-SDK"
    },
    {
      "id": "A8",
      "decision": "Tenant-scoped account routes belong to AUTH-TENANT-BLOCKING.",
      "decidedBy": "owner (t-k)",
      "decidedOn": "2026-09-23",
      "movedTo": "AUTH-TENANT-BLOCKING"
    },
    {
      "id": "A9",
      "decision": "Custom-token account creation belongs to AUTH-CREDENTIAL; email-link accounts belong to AUTH-ACTION.",
      "decidedBy": "owner (t-k)",
      "decidedOn": "2026-09-23",
      "movedTo": "AUTH-CREDENTIAL"
    },
    {
      "id": "A10",
      "decision": "MFA factors in imported accounts belong to AUTH-MFA; AUTH-ACCOUNT imports without factors.",
      "decidedBy": "owner (t-k)",
      "decidedOn": "2026-09-23",
      "movedTo": "AUTH-MFA"
    },
    {
      "id": "A11",
      "decision": "Multi-expression query semantics are decided by production observation in auth-account/admin/query, not by documentation.",
      "decidedBy": "owner (t-k)",
      "decidedOn": "2026-09-23"
    },
    {
      "id": "A12",
      "decision": "Historical owner decision: the gson parser message for malformed customAttributes JSON was accepted as a message-text divergence. The source-bound replay against artifact a8bfc5dc1737dee01bae028b2e3dd421f04326e12640cb4936d896ebfcfa358a now matches this exact input, including the two app-visible message fields. The historical decision is retained; no claim is made about unobserved malformed Gson inputs.",
      "decidedBy": "owner",
      "decidedOn": "2026-09-24",
      "supersededForClosure": true
    }
  ],
